message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AI-Powered Dynamic Pricing Optimization System"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2025-06-01"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/ai-dynamic-pricing/ai-dynamic-pricing"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ai-dynamic-pricing/ai-dynamic-pricing"
keywords:
  - dynamic-pricing
  - revenue-optimization
  - reinforcement-learning
  - demand-forecasting
  - pricing-strategy
  - mlops
  - explainable-ai
abstract: >
  Enterprise-grade AI dynamic pricing platform combining demand forecasting
  (XGBoost/LightGBM/CatBoost/Prophet/LSTM/GRU/Transformer), elasticity-based
  revenue optimization, reinforcement learning pricing agents (DQN/PPO/Bandit),
  customer segmentation, anomaly detection, explainable AI (SHAP/LIME),
  competitor intelligence, and a generative AI pricing advisor, across 10
  industries including e-commerce, retail, airline, and hotel pricing.
